 "descricao": "Aquatica by Rayhaan is a Citrus Gourmand fragrance for men. This is a new fragrance. Aquatica was launched in 2025. Top notes are Lime, Coconut Milk, Bergamot and Mandarin; middle notes are Sugar Cane, Jasmine, Hibiscus and Gardenia; base notes are Musk, Rum, Tonka Bean and Patchouli.\nAquatica is an aquatic fragrance for men that opens with a bright citrus blend of bergamot, lime, and mandarin, complemented by coconut milk. The heart develops with jasmine, gardenia, and hibiscus alongside sugarcane, contributing a floral and slightly tropical character. The composition settles into a base of patchouli, musk, tonka bean, and rum, providing a warm and creamy finish with gourmand undertones.",
